00127:       "T completes a harmless ordinary legal action first, then U ordinary FocusEnergy reaches the whole-move failure. No Snatch, Dancer, Instruct, switching, future attack, weather/terrain damage/healing or ability/item handler between that failure and Octolock changes the global flag or clears Octolock. No fainting or decision writes. Default settings including affection off."
